  applied_summary: Public naming, folder names, file names, comments, PHP prefixes, static discovery files, docs links, and .uai routing now use Runtime.MiRust.com / runtime-mirust.
  truth_boundary: GGUF remains a technical model-format boundary and roadmap topic; it is no longer the site/domain brand.


## Plain PHP rebuild v1.0.5

The WordPress deployment path is superseded. Runtime.MiRust.com now ships as a root-extractable plain PHP site with `/index.php`, `/inc/site.php`, `/data/pages.json`, `/assets/`, `/docs/`, and `/.uai/`. See `/docs/implementation/runtime-mirust-plain-php-rebuild-v1.0.5.md`.


